==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Youcan]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you wish to do so, most of the enemies on the stage are timer based and can be exhausted before hitting the base. Bring Breakerblast for Youcan's Barrier and at least one good counter to it. Anti-Aliens are highly recommended.

